CI-treated solid tumor patients, reporting absolute concentrations of inosine and SCFAs, with correlation to clinical response. Prioritize paired serum-tumor-stool cohorts.\n    *   Reason: All provided materials explicitly state that absolute physiological concentrations of inosine and SCFAs within the human TME correlating with ICI response are currently unreported. Available human data is limited to relative plasma stratification or fecal proxies, while inosine mechanistic data is confined to murine models. The specific quantitative TME requirement remains a documented literature gap.\n\n6.  **Refine & Format Output (JSON):**\n    *   Check `quantitative_comparisons` format: `[\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"...\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"...\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"...\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"...\",\n        \"value\": \"...\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]`\n    *   I will extract exactly what's in the text.\n    *   Item 1: Plasma inosine in RCC patients treated with nivolumab. Result: Median OS 33 months vs 22 months. Setting: Baseline plasma analysis. Groups: [\n  {\n    \"group\": \"High inosine\",\n    \"value\": \"33 months\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"group\": \"Low inosine\",\n    \"value\": \"22 months\"\n  }\n]\n    *   Item 2: Serum L-arginine in multicohort ICI study. Result: Associated with poor ICI outcomes. Setting: Serum measurement. Groups: [\n  {\n    \"group\": \"<42 μM\",\n    \"value\": \"poor outcomes\"\n  }\n]\n    *   (Note: SCFA data lacks exact numbers in the text, so I won't force them. I'll stick to the explicit ones.)\n    *   `usable_content`: 当前文献尚未报道在人类肿瘤微环境（TME）或间质液中直接测量的肌苷和短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）绝对生理浓度及其与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的相关性。现有临床数据主要依赖粪便样本或全身血浆的相对丰度分层：在接受纳武利尤单抗治疗的肾细胞癌患者中，基线血浆肌苷水平较高者中位总生存期为33个月，低于22个月；在实体瘤抗PD-1治疗队列中，较高的粪便乙酸、丙酸、丁酸和戊酸浓度与更长的无进展生存期及更好响应相关，但血清丁酸和丙酸水平升高却与抗CTLA-4疗效呈负相关。机制层面，肌苷增强抗肿瘤免疫的证据主要来自小鼠模型，显示其通过直接结合并抑制肿瘤细胞内的泛素激活酶UBA6，减少FAT10介导的降解，上调MHC-I表达，并在单细胞测序中观察到CD8+ T细胞和M1型巨噬细胞浸润增加；该作用高度依赖IFN-γ的存在。SCFAs调节免疫的机